#### Canonical entity + reference

```json
// docs/design/seam-contracts/_components/ClaimStatus.json
{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "ClaimStatus",
  "title": "ClaimStatus",
  "enum": ["RECEIVED", "ADJUDICATED", "PAID", "DENIED"],
  "x-owning-context": "claims"
}
```

```json
// a consumer (openapi.json or asyncapi.json) references — never inlines — it
{ "status": { "$ref": "../_components/ClaimStatus.json" } }
```
